      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104790326",
      "date": "26-11-11 22:55",
      "text": "科技这边你要真让我说，反弹，\n半导体\n的逻辑要比光顺畅",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104790281",
      "date": "26-11-11 22:53",
      "text": "五角大楼列入清单的中国\n军工\n企业，包括\n中际旭创\n，不应为美国的\n数据中心\n布线",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104790239",
      "date": "26-11-11 22:52",
      "text": "感觉都差点意思诶 核心还是在3梯队",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104790186",
      "date": "26-11-11 22:50",
      "text": "刚反弹完又来利空了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104790133",
      "date": "26-11-11 22:49",
      "text": "那你忘了他的属性了吗 这个周末的时候讲过",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104782993",
      "date": "26-11-11 19:34",
      "text": "【11.11圆宝收评】简单写一下，光之王者的回归让不少科技人又蠢蠢欲动了，回归的原因大家应该也都看到了，就是微软游说抵制FCC禁令的事情，首先这个消息是昨天晚上的事情，并不是今天盘中的事情，往好了说光模块的悲观已经提前反应过了，往坏了说蓝色党派的优势还在。\n至于传闻里面说的两家龙头厂商已拿到Google的NPO订单，也就是大光和二光，但如果按照今天盘面所看，强度必须是\n剑桥科技\n，明天需要看他的脸色。\n情绪这边还是主升阶段，最大的特征是容错率还在，昨天说了二进三是必争之地，从结果来看哪怕没有晋级，盘中都给了体面离场的机会，只不过闽发最终还是选择了绕异动的方式，那后面这批下方的梯队后续都会模仿，大概率会有二三梯队的模仿闽东，从题材来看三梯队的五只票，代表了四个题材，这个在后期一定是要pk的，如果要主观排除法，我主观排除掉光伏。\n话说另一头，传媒尾盘的回落和\n机器人\n的日内萎靡，都是因为科技的反弹把量能吸走了一部分，毕竟这两者的诞生都是在科技最狗不理的时候启动的，前者传媒强于机器人是因为盘中几猫\n游戏\n事件的发酵。\n最后，今天市场并没有放量，那科技的强度就需要后面放量的时候再确认，客观盘面上展示的是四个需要卡异动的都卡住了，那就代表昨天节点效应还在，老周期继续。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104781664",
      "date": "26-11-11 18:53",
      "text": "今天没有复盘哈，明天早盘照常，也不难为你们了哈哈",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104780743",
      "date": "26-11-11 18:25",
      "text": "投机这边该控异动的有失败的吗？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104780717",
      "date": "26-11-11 18:24",
      "text": "哈哈这不是前几天886060和881274吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104767784",
      "date": "26-11-11 14:36",
      "text": "每天捞就是这样",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104764893",
      "date": "26-11-11 13:51",
      "text": "祝福哦",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104762237",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:54",
      "text": "反正这种突发，然后中午一发酵，容易被量化割\n去也是轻轻的去",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104761956",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:45",
      "text": "你想想只需要1.4m，到底利空谁",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104761724",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:38",
      "text": "现在反应是真快啊",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/11/11/9j1vn29e4bzn.png_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104761612",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:34",
      "text": "做t呢他",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104760910",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:14",
      "text": "对的",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104760905",
      "date": "26-11-11 12:14",
      "text": "中青宝\n走的是黄果",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104760190",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:57",
      "text": "安卓也可以",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104760172",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:57",
      "text": "对的 反映最大的是\n汤姆猫\n和富春",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104760054",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:54",
      "text": "下午看看反馈",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/11/11/r4x0ap3hmwgb.png_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104759847",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:50",
      "text": "补充一下，刚才和业内人士交流了一下，这个\n游戏\n全是静态代码做出来的实时渲染，没有调用任何外部资源，而且只有1.4M（一张高清图片都不止1.4M），一会看看盘面反馈吧。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104759639",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:45",
      "text": "你们玩一下那个\n游戏\n，感受下看看哈哈哈",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104759403",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:41",
      "text": "希望吧 让我的认购飞起来\n但事实是，某队没有在买，好像在卖",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104759185",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:38",
      "text": "《几猫国产3A大作》，就是刚才传播的那个手搓FPS\n游戏\n，我玩了一下还可以\n关联的A股应该是昆仑，但市场拉的是富春和\n汤姆猫",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104759122",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:37",
      "text": "是的 让我文明",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-23?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104758575",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:29",
      "text": "对的哈哈哈",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-23?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104758387",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:26",
      "text": "你看 我就说打赏点赞推油的人 都有好运吧",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-23?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104758230",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:24",
      "text": "不怼了 古天乐提醒我了都",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-23?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104758007",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:20",
      "text": "供应链在传:华为极目首台人形\n机器人\n即将发布，已经打磨整整三年，直接对标\n特斯拉\nOptimus。不是单纯做技术演示，发布即可接单试点，优先供应B端商用。\n就是这条~",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-24?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104757683",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:16",
      "text": "我一年光为信息付费就好几万的",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-24?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104757496",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:14",
      "text": "不见得错了吧",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-24?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104757220",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:10",
      "text": "你们看见\n金杯汽车\n的小作文了吗？拉不上去就发小作文，这帮人真行哇",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-24?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104757023",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:08",
      "text": "我说话了呀亲 我上午不是跟你们聊天了吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-25?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104756822",
      "date": "26-11-11 11:05",
      "text": "挺无聊的一天，昨天节点定了大方向后，今天依然以传媒\n游戏\n，\n机器人\n轮动的一天。\n高位那四个卡异动的，既然选择没主动突破，那后续就是模仿豆浆机绕异动玩了。\n如果不想去高位，低位比较安全的，目前看就是机器人了，嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-25?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104753113",
      "date": "26-11-11 10:18",
      "text": "小张不是告诉你了吗 拿不住你就去拿锄头种地",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-25?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104753005",
      "date": "26-11-11 10:16",
      "text": "受虐狂呀",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-25?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104752517",
      "date": "26-11-11 10:11",
      "text": "你净睁着眼说瞎话哇，人家好几天开盘就在五日线",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-26?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104751995",
      "date": "26-11-11 10:05",
      "text": "天洋这种就等卡顿卖呗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-26?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104751546",
      "date": "26-11-11 10:00",
      "text": "哈哈哈不急 那我就明天发~",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-26?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104751411",
      "date": "26-11-11 09:59",
      "text": "今天还没有打开账户",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-26?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104751307",
      "date": "26-11-11 09:58",
      "text": "咋了 which one",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-27?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104748200",
      "date": "26-11-11 09:02",
      "text": "又是美好的一天开始了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-28?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104818603",
      "date": "26-11-12 14:02",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈你是今天最可爱的人",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104817994",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:55",
      "text": "挨打就要立正",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104817787",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:53",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈这图我看一次笑一次",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104817759",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:52",
      "text": "你问我这个\n机器人\n终结者吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104817497",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:50",
      "text": "好滴 刍刍",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104816640",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:41",
      "text": "别急哭",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104816622",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:41",
      "text": "好滴狗狗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104816380",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:38",
      "text": "上午吵吵着要抄我的兄弟们，你们还好吗？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104814857",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:23",
      "text": "如果绕异动这个是真的\n那就应该\n一条直线下来",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104814586",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:20",
      "text": "盘中两个小作文在发酵\n1、jg核查海外链ai风显敞口，\n2、短线改绕异动规则。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104814349",
      "date": "26-11-12 13:18",
      "text": "盘中两个小作文在发酵\n1、jg核查海外链ai风显敞口，\n2、短线改绕异动规则。\n点评：\n前者是保护，但短期情绪上利崆光模块，所以盘中跳水。\n后者对绕异动，尤其对连板、对妖股炒作属于降温。\n你说的是这个吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104807898",
      "date": "26-11-12 11:21",
      "text": "开盘最亮眼的科技，截至目前都回落的很厉害，而市场又是放量的，等于科技这里轿子更重了。\n而情绪端这里有两个问题：\n1、这波周期里几个大资金的主战场：宇树，\n上海电影\n，芒果，凡拓，今天都有被兑现的迹象\n2、宇宙总龙豆浆机今天2%附近就要异动，上午有点太猛了\n这几个迹象都不太好，稳一手。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104807730",
      "date": "26-11-12 11:19",
      "text": "科技还是回落了，希望不是我上文说的坏预期，再康康也没毛病。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104807254",
      "date": "26-11-12 11:13",
      "text": "也有人疯狂卖 在努力控",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104806370",
      "date": "26-11-12 11:03",
      "text": "✔",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104805991",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:59",
      "text": "福莱很明显啊 你看他的债",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104805900",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:58",
      "text": "我已经走了啊早上",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104804455",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:43",
      "text": "who",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104804350",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:41",
      "text": "我感觉\n机器人\n又要演我了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104803691",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:35",
      "text": "我也不知道为啥啊\n我一买他就跌破五日线 我真服了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104803282",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:31",
      "text": "md 都要嘲笑我了",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/011.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104803256",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:30",
      "text": "嗯呢 所以我说再康康",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104802855",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:26",
      "text": "光 不是 关 打错字",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104802517",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:23",
      "text": "大小切换，本轮反弹\n打错字了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104802346",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:21",
      "text": "好的预期：预测量能放大，将近两万亿，科技以科创为主的国产链条继续向上，那后面就等小分歧根据承接找机会上，相当于小的大小风格切换。\n坏的预期：本来反弹是以1104为开始，当时最强的是科创\n半导体\n，那今天继续拉了科创为主，随着周期内的所有牛逼的东西开始变弱，比如\n上海电影\n，那么我也可以理解为反弹周期闭环。\n综上，如果把指数昨天看作底部确认，那今天的二板就有说法了，基本上还是光和傻比\n机器人\n，But，昨天并不是节点。\n结论：再康康",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104801525",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:14",
      "text": "✔",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104801002",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:09",
      "text": "昨天晚上我还说了一句\n半导体\n的逻辑要比光顺的多 结果今天就拉了 那\n科创50\ndong一下子涨了60%",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104799986",
      "date": "26-11-12 10:00",
      "text": "你们谁有权限，我教你们学这个算逑了",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/11/12/539gckiogc0o.jpg_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104799314",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:53",
      "text": "真走了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104799296",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:53",
      "text": "宇\n兆",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104799073",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:51",
      "text": "机器人\n误我啊！！",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/11/12/ocw0r6gd59oc.jpg_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104798732",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:48",
      "text": "唉 犹豫就会败北\n错过50%",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104798399",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:45",
      "text": "我的\n机器人\n五日线跌破 我走了",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/011.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104797856",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:39",
      "text": "科技这边持续性勉强还可以，量能也在放大",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104797362",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:28",
      "text": "海洋绕开异动一字开，3梯队的\n达意隆\n，4梯队的锋龙一字开，",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104796350",
      "date": "26-11-12 09:07",
      "text": "补充一下，明天会比较精彩，一是豆浆机明天是卡异动最后一天，二是\n新华传媒\n今天最后一天出监管，明天存在天高任鸟飞预期，相对应的也会影响到豆浆机。\n要么新华拉板虹吸豆浆机，造成后者在卡异动最后一天提前兑现，要么助推后者卡异动失败，周末二者被神罚，周一直接开摆。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "104793863",
      "date": "26-11-12 08:01",
      "text": "【11.12圆宝早盘】\n在情绪爆发的次日，F4都被按住了，那今天大概率也没事，周期继续。\n但我昨天发现三个现象：\n1、很多人开始无脑相信野某，不是说他不好，但这一幕似成相识。（24年的61，25年的群总，好像都是这个同时间段被奉为神明）\n2、自媒体上晒单F4的B点图的开始变多了。\n3、科技异动，敲醒不少沉睡的心灵，但科技这里套牢盘依然很重，如果在不合适的节点就有人加仓，只会让轿子更重。\n上述三点，如果从零和博弈的角度思考，解决方法只有一条：两市持续放量，完成筹码接力。\n所以客观上，今天指数必须放量1.8万亿继续猛攻，不然按自媒体上的热度，这两条线都会有不少的新增筹码压力。\n所以主观上，我还是看题材多一点，无非就是传媒，\n机器人\n，羊字辈等。\n之前提过，前天节点日的阵眼是阳光，他和闽发形成周期一致性，那通过昨天的盘面，很明显可以看到，资金在周期上偏好的是辨识度的缩容，例如青岛，百洋已出现掉队迹象。\n所以在周五前，虽然周期会继续，但操作难度会越来越大，而外部还有一堆右侧选手等着进场，感觉离新临界点越来越近了。\n备选：等盘中拆解！\n今日八字箴言【需要放量，才可猛攻】！兄们可以把这八个字打在评论区提醒自己～祝好",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2wCcj3k7tWA-15?type=new"
    }
  ],
